1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:07,800
This is Ballot: polls on Ethereum where every single vote can be proven.
Anyone can create a poll, and every wallet gets exactly one vote.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,800
First, connect your wallet.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:21,800
Then create a poll: a question, two to ten options, and a deadline.
The smart contract enforces the rules, and once it's signed, nobody can edit it, not even us.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:34,800
To vote, pick an option. The app checks your vote before your wallet even opens.
Once it's confirmed, you get a ballot receipt: the transaction, block and time, read straight from the blockchain.
Anyone can verify it on Etherscan.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,800
Results update live, for everyone, with no wallet needed.

6
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,800
Ballot. Every vote, provable.
